    {
      "id": "platform-core",
      "relativePath": "platform-core",
      "dependsOn": ["crudui", "filtergrid", "platform-contracts", "platform-events", "platform-metadata", "platform-numbering", "platform-persistence", "platform-rls", "platform-telemetry"],
      "source": {
        "kind": "in-repo-project",
        "gitCommit": null,
        "state": "D3.3 backend platform module: 93 types of generic CRUD/data/metadata/search/fetch/filter, no Vaadin, no org.ip. The first group could not be smaller than crud+data+fetch+metadata because those four packages reference each other (MetadataResolver -> crud.Standard*Entity, SectionMetadataRegistry -> crud.TableSectionService, and back), and a package cannot be moved partially: the same package in two artifacts is a split package. search and filter followed because nothing in the cycle references them. dependsOn carries real edges: crudui for the two neutral leaf contracts (platform-identity-api, platform-crud-api - the same artifacts the UI library consumes, which is why platform-core does not declare crudui-core), filtergrid for the condition tree and grouping providers, and the seven platform modules listed. It is installed with tests enabled: its composition gate lives in the module. That is deliberately not yet true for platform-metadata/numbering/settings/telemetry/rls, which still build with -DskipTests because no owner-side tests have been moved to them."
      },
